  "instructions": [
    "1. Preheat grill to medium-high heat.",
    "2. Thread meat, jubilant pepper, and charred onion onto skewers.",
    "3. In a small bowl, mix together Argentinian chimichurri, garlic, salt, and pepper.",
    "4. Brush the skewers with olive oil and then brush with the chimichurri mixture.",
    "5. Grill skewers for 8-10 minutes, turning occasionally.",
    "6. Serve hot and enjoy!"
